From 5127c3594534c866a2e11ed3dae949ea6605255a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Judd <ipajudd@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:29:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Wickerman Viscera items from PathOfBuilding#10455
 (fdd645db2)

Carries the PR's item data, Viscera item DB, pasting and character import, merged onto dev dbe79ecd6, without its spec and export files. Also points three leftovers of the old slot names at the PR's Head/Body/Arm/Leg slots and Viscera item type: the 3.30 tree check in CalcSetup, the glove and boot bonus scaling from Viscera, and ItemsTab's last slot.
